  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia - Reduced deforestation and rural poverty</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reduced deforestation and rural poverty through sustainable land use. The project will target local and ethnic communities to improve land management skills, establishing silvopastoral systems for more sustainable livestock production and diversify family orchards to improve productivity and food security without adding pressure to the forest. Also develop advocacy campaigns to raise awareness, help identify forest-friendly niches and financial tools, and strengthen local civil societies.</narrative>
  </description>
